{"seq":1,"slug":"education-fundamentals","title":"教育学基础","stage":"DONE","category":"education","chapterCount":3,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 教育学基础 简介\n\n教育学是研究教育现象和教育问题、揭示教育规律的社会科学。作为一门古老而常新的学科，教育学的理论体系涵盖了从教育目的到教学方法、从学习机制到教育制度的广泛议题。理解教育学的基本原理，不仅对教育工作者至关重要，也能帮助技术从业者更好地设计学习产品和教育工具。\n\n本知识库系统梳理教育学的核心理论基础，面向教育技术从业者、课程设计师和对教育理论感兴趣的技术人员。\n\n第1章**教育哲学**从哲学层面审视教育的本质问题，探讨教育的目的与价值以及影响深远的教育思想家的核心贡献。\n\n第2章**学习理论**深入讲解三大经典学习理论流派——行为主义、建构主义和社会文化理论，帮助读者理解学习发生的机制和条件。\n\n第3章**教育体系**从制度和政策视角审视教育系统，介绍教育体系模型、比较教育学和教育政策改革等宏观议题。\n\n建议读者从第1章的哲学思考开始，建立对教育本质的深层理解，再通过第2章的学习理论掌握核心方法论，最后通过第3章获得宏观视野。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"education-philosophy","title":"教育哲学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-of-education","title":"教育哲学概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-philosophy/philosophy-of-education"},{"seq":2,"slug":"educational-purpose-values","title":"教育目的与价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-philosophy/educational-purpose-values"},{"seq":3,"slug":"major-educational-thinkers","title":"重要教育思想家","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-philosophy/major-educational-thinkers"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"learning-theories","title":"学习理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/learning-theories","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"behaviorist-learning","title":"行为主义学习理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/learning-theories/behaviorist-learning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"constructivist-learning","title":"建构主义学习理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/learning-theories/constructivist-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sociocultural-learning","title":"社会文化学习理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/learning-theories/sociocultural-learning"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"education-systems","title":"教育体系","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"education-system-models","title":"教育体系模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/education-system-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"comparative-education","title":"比较教育学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/comparative-education"},{"seq":3,"slug":"education-policy-reform","title":"教育政策与改革","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/education-policy-reform"},{"seq":4,"slug":"global-education-systems","title":"各国教育体制比较","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/global-education-systems"},{"seq":5,"slug":"k12-higher-education","title":"K-12 与高等教育","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/k12-higher-education"},{"seq":6,"slug":"lifelong-informal-education","title":"终身学习与非正式教育","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/education-fundamentals/education-systems/lifelong-informal-education"}]}]}